ndiatimes.com/india/keeps-insulting-divine-feminine-bjp-targets-rahul-gandhi-over-sexual-misconduct-allegations-against-congress-leaders/articleshow/135828108.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135828108.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[The Bharatiya Janata Party (BJP) has launched a scathing critique of Congress regarding its failure to address women's safety amidst severe allegations. BJP MP Bansuri Swaraj pointed out the lack of accountability among Congress leaders, citing instances such as a Jharkhand MLA accused of raping a minor and sexual harassment allegations against another Congress MP.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/keeps-insulting-divine-feminine-bjp-targets-rahul-gandhi-over-sexual-misconduct-allegations-against-congress-leaders/articleshow/135828108.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/keeps-insulting-divine-feminine-bjp-targets-rahul-gandhi-over-sexual-misconduct-allegations-against-congress-leaders/articleshow/135828108.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-14T14:40:01+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Mahima Sharma</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135828267,imgsize-93962.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Mekedatu Dam row: Stalin seeks united Tamil Nadu stand, asks Vijay to call all-party meeting]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/mekedatu-dam-row-stalin-seeks-united-tamil-nadu-stand-asks-vijay-to-call-all-party-meeting/articleshow/135827511.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135827511.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[MK Stalin has requested Chief Minister Joseph Vijay to hold an all-party meeting about the Mekedatu dam project. He emphasizes the importance 